  "description": "RT Blazorfied HTML Editor is a free .NET Blazor component that provides accessibility features and a wide variety of elements and customizations that make it one of the most robust and flexible HTML editors available. It allows the programmer to apply custom .css files to the preview window, to see how the content will be displayed in production. It allows you to add custom buttons and has a wide variety of other features. The buttons use embedded .svg Google Font Icons and the editor uses shadow DOM to isolate the HTML from inheriting the existing page styles.",
