  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Note, the editor CSS styles were recently moved into CSS global variables a few versions back. This release: 1) ability to add a custom button functionality; 2) new file menu; 3) new find feature; 4) keyboard shortcuts dialog; 5) incline code button; 6) context menus; 7) consistent formatting with lists; 8) tool bar overflow (More options button); and many other usability improvements...",
